🩹 33. Missing Value Imputation

Replace with Mean

df["Age"] = df["Age"].fillna(
    df["Age"].mean()
)

Replace with Median

df["Age"] = df["Age"].fillna(
    df["Age"].median()
)

Replace with Mode

df["City"] = df["City"].fillna(
    df["City"].mode()[0]
)

Drop Missing Rows

df.dropna()

> 💡 Important: The best imputation method depends on the data and the reason values are missing.




